Prop Law Rev</source><comment>In press</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0060262-b011"><citation citation-type="journal"><collab>&#x0005b;No authors listed&#x0005d;</collab><year>2002</year><article-title>Innovation's golden goose</article-title><source>The Economist</source><volume>365</volume><fpage>3</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0060262-b012"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group><name><surname>Pitroda</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Letter to Indian Prime Minister from The National Knowledge Commission</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://knowledgecommission.gov.in/downloads/recommendations/LegislationPM.pdf">http://knowledgecommission.gov.in/downloads/recommendations/LegislationPM.pdf</ext-link>. Accessed 16 September 2008</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0060262-b013"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Sampat</surname><given-names>BN</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Patenting and US academic research in the 20th century: The world before and after Bayh-Dole</article-title><source>Res Pol</source><volume>35</volume><fpage>772</fpage><lpage>789</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0060262-b014"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Cohen</surname><given-names>WM</given-names></name><name><surname>Nelson</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Walsh</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Links and impacts: The influence of public research on industrial R&#x00026;D</article-title><source>Manage Sci</source><volume>48</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>23</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0060262-b015"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Agrawal</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Henderson</surname><given-names>R</given-nam